OL,5,G0935 Outback Truckers
OL,6,     FTurbo is in a difficult situation
OL,7,     Fas he pushes his truck and himself
OL,8,     Fto their breaking points; Mark is
OL,9,     Fforced to face the toughest job of
OL,10,     Fhis career.
OL,11,G1030 Outback Truckers
OL,12,     FMidway through a vital run Turbo
OL,13,     Fis feeling the temperature as his
OL,14,     Frig overheats. Meanwhile, Mark
OL,15,     FCromwell is fighting to complete
OL,16,     Fthe biggest job of his career.
