OL,5,G1230 Gunsmoke
OL,6,     FWhen a dying deputy swears in Thad
OL,7,     Fto capture killer Fred Bateman,
OL,8,     FThad ends up in a Quaker town,
OL,9,     Fwhere the people cannot tell which
OL,10,     Fone is the wanted man.
OL,11,G1335 Gunsmoke
OL,12,     FChad Timpson takes care of his
OL,13,     Fbrother, who has with a learning
OL,14,     Fdisability. But a rider who comes
OL,15,     Finto Dodge knows of Chad's
OL,16,     Fcheckered past that may break up
OL,17,     Fthe two brothers.
